if {Naledi.hippo_has_roller} == true:
    Naledi: That is an interesting thing you are rolling around.
    Naledi: I have heard of them. Hippo Rollers. My aunt's village had one, years ago.
    Naledi: ...She said it changed everything.
    Naledi: Well. Good morning.
else:
    Naledi: Good morning.
    Naledi: Let me know if you need anything from the stall.